    "Sources: pinned posteriordb Stan accel_splines.stan and the assigned native models/posteriordb_accel_splines_*.py builder(s). Original constrained parameter shapes/index order are preserved unless explicitly mapped below; automatic support-transform Jacobians are disabled in both engines.",
